  "question": {
    "text": "Consider $\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{y}{4} \\geq 1$ and $\\frac{x}{3}+\\frac{y}{2} \\leq 1, x, y \\geq 0$. Then\r\n\r\nnumber of possible solutions are :",
    "image": null
  },
